      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        -380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Review a saved creation brief\n\nSelect a private **Bearer Auth** credential containing your organization-scoped Engage API key on every HTTP node. Requires `templates:read`. Enter your organizationId and an owned journeyId.\n\nThe workflow lists the first 50 saved briefs, then reads the selected brief and its checkpoint state. Use nextCursor to page further. It does not generate, export, activate or send media.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6e605652-209d-4fc9-825a-294d80029e0a",
      "name": "Run manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "313c5f93-195c-4204-84cc-28068f6a5c0f",
      "name": "Brief inputs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "5d5d1f43-dc65-4ae5-bf96-9ed637308fbc",
              "name": "organizationId",
              "value": "REPLACE_WITH_ORGANIZATION_UUID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "45d2e3d5-aaed-421a-8edd-34d44b6e4028",
